                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Yerobowamu, n’ivyo yakoze vyose, n’ivy’ ubuhizi bgiwe, n’ingene yarwanye intambara, n’uburyo yagaruriye Ubgisirayeli i Damasiko n’i Hamati, ahanyaze Abayuda, none ntivyanditswe mu gitabo c’ivyo ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yerobowamu ahamvya ba sekuruza, ari bo bami b’Abisirayeli; umuhungu wiwe Zekariya asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
